Third-party models and data
----------------------------

This plugin does not bundle any model weights or imagery. It downloads them on
demand at your request. Each carries its own licence and attribution terms,
which are the user's responsibility to observe:

* Clay v1.5 — Clay Foundation (a program of Renaissance Philanthropy).
  Code and weights: Apache-2.0. Documentation: CC-BY.
  Weights: Hugging Face "made-with-clay/Clay" (clay-v1.5.ckpt).

* Prithvi-EO-2.0 — IBM + NASA.
  Weights: Apache-2.0 (confirm per weight file). Distributed on Hugging Face
  ("ibm-nasa-geospatial/Prithvi-EO-2.0-*"). Pre-trained on NASA Harmonized
  Landsat-Sentinel (HLS) V2.

* SatlasPretrain — Allen Institute for AI (AI2).
  Checkpoints: ODC-BY. Distributed via the "satlaspretrain-models" package.
  Note: SatlasPretrain (the models) is distinct from "Satlas", AI2's separately
  published pre-computed thematic map products.

